      "verdict": "De-facto open-weights reranker default; tooling pain (broken GGUFs, no Ollama, slow llama.cpp path)",
      "summary": "Widely used on Macs, including the 0.6B in local agent pipelines. Vendor scores: 4B MMTEB-R 72.7, 8B 72.9, bge-reranker-v2-m3 58.4; MTEB maintainers could not reproduce Qwen's reranking scores. Most community GGUFs lack the classifier head and return scores near 0. llama.cpp decoder rerank is about 6x slower than necessary (open issue).",
